      "writtenOn": "2026-03-27T15:43:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t like that you\u0027re adding another layer of weak override to the board version retrieval and don\u0027t like that you\u0027re modifying the definition of \tCBI_TAG_BOARD_VERSION for a one-off use for RVP platforms.\n\nWhat does coreboot do with this information?  Depthcharge already calls EC_CMD_PD_CHIP_INFO for each type-c port to check if a FW update is needed.",
